cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "foodweb-3d: an open, 3D-interactive, uncertainty-aware food-web simulation framework for regulated inland waters"
abstract: >-
  A spatially explicit framework that interconnects static mass-balance,
  dynamic trophic, and physical water-body models through a model-agnostic
  interchange format (L2), with a 3D-interactive, time-animated,
  uncertainty-aware renderer and two-way physics–trophic coupling.
  Demonstrated on the Yangtze / Three Gorges Reservoir.
type: software
version: "0.3.0"
